    "chunk_text": "An accomplished scholar, he holds a Master's Degree in Defence Studies from General Sir John Kotelawala Defence University and a Master's Degree in International Security and Strategy from King's College London.\n\nFor his gallantry during humanitarian operations, he was awarded the Rana Sura Padakkama. In recognition of his exemplary service, impeccable conduct and unwavering dedication to duty, he was also awarded the Uttama Seva Padakkama. Furthermore, he has received six Letters of Commendation from successive Commanders of the Sri Lanka Navy for his outstanding professional service.\n\nA keen sportsman, Vice Admiral Fernando has represented the Sri Lanka Navy Cricket Team as a player and had also served as the Chairman of the Sri Lanka Navy Cricket Association previously.\n\nThe occasion was attended by the Commander of the Navy\u2019s beloved spouse, Mrs. Kaushalya Opatha Fernando, their daughters Kalsha Fernando and Cecilia Fernando and their son Febian Fernando."
  },
