    "chunk_text": "Designed for hoteliers, marketing directors, hotel owners and industry decision-makers, EME Level Up: AI Hospitality Connect, Sri Lanka 2026 will offer practical insights, thought leadership, and real-world perspectives to help hospitality brands remain competitive in today\u2019s rapidly evolving digital landscape.\n\n\"EME Level Up: AI Hospitality Connect, Sri Lanka 2026 presents a prime opportunity for hospitality leaders to connect with industry experts, explore the evolving role of AI and digital marketing in hospitality, and gain valuable insights into the future of digital hospitality,\" said eMarketingEye CEO Rajitha Dahanayake.\n\nEME Level Up: AI Hospitality Connect, Sri Lanka 2026 is proudly hosted by eMarketingEye, in collaboration with supporting partners Aven Hospitality, TrustYou, and Lighthouse, bringing together leading industry expertise and innovation to support meaningful dialogue within the hospitality sector. The event is further amplified through the support of TravelTalk Asia as the Official Trade Media Partner and DailyFT as the Official Print Media Partner.\n\nFor more information on EME Level Up: AI Hospitality Connect, Sri Lanka 2026, and to request a pass for this conference please visit:"
