    "chunk_size_bytes": 1292,
    "chunk_text": "Sabrina Esufally appointed to Hemas Holdings Board\n\nHemas Holdings PLC yesterday announced the appointment of Sabrina Esufally as an Executive Director to its Board, effective 1 July 2026.\n\nEsufally is the Managing Director of Hemas Consumer Brands and a member of the Hemas Group Board of Management.\n\nSince joining the Group in 2019, she has held leadership roles across pharmaceutical manufacturing, business development, innovation, and consumer brands.\n\nSince assuming leadership of Hemas Consumer Brands, Sabrina has led one of the Group\u2019s strategically significant businesses, expanding into new consumer segments through innovation while strengthening its portfolio of trusted brands.\n\nAs Hemas continues to expand its presence to frontier markets, Sabrina brings commercial leadership experience and a strong consumer perspective to the Board, complementing its collective expertise and supporting the Group\u2019s long-term strategic ambitions.\n\nPrior to joining Hemas, Sabrina served as Head of Legal Research at Verit\u00e9 Research, specialising in governance and public policy. She is an Attorney-at-Law of the Supreme Court of Sri Lanka, holds a First Class Honours degree from the University of Durham, an LL.M. from Harvard Law School, and is an alumna of Harvard Business School."
