    "description": "Govt. launches El Ni\u00f1o task force,orders two-week preparedness plans",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/Govt-launches-El-Ni\u00f1o-task-force-orders-two-week-preparedness-plans/34-794097",
    "lang": "en",
