    "description": "Could El Ni\u00f1o become an FX risk for Sri Lanka?",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Could-El-Ni\u00f1o-become-an-FX-risk-for-Sri-Lanka/4-794126",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
