    "chunk_size_bytes": 521,
    "chunk_text": "Court dismisses Yoshitha\u2019s revision application relating to \u201cMenik Malla\u201d case\n\nThe Court of Appeal today dismissed a revision application filed by Yoshitha Rajapaksa in connection with the money laundering case widely known as the \u201cMenik Malla\u201d case.\n\nThe revision application challenged a ruling of the Colombo High Court that rejected a preliminary objection raised by the defence during the trial proceedings.\n\nThe judgment was delivered by a bench comprising Justices Amal Ranaraja and Sumudu Premachandra."
