    "description": "\u2018How to protect your wealth from rising inflation with Unit Trusts and diversification\u2019",
    "url_metadata": "http://island.lk/how-to-protect-your-wealth-from-rising-inflation-with-unit-trusts-and-diversification/",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "islandlk",
