    "chunk_text": "This collaboration between Adhitya Ayurveda and Shriveda Ayurveda Korea represents a shared vision of making authentic Ayurvedic knowledge accessible to a wider international audience while building meaningful bridges between cultures through health and wellness.\n\nHe added, \u201cWe extend our sincere appreciation to Shriveda Ayurveda Korea, all participants, and our wellness partners for their support and enthusiasm. Together, we are creating new opportunities to share the timeless wisdom of Ayurveda beyond borders and contribute to a healthier future for global communities.\u201d\n\nThe Adhitya Ayurveda family includes one of Sri Lanka\u2019s leading holistic healing and luxury resorts nestled in the heart of Anuradhapura. It is an ISO-certified, award-winning retreat where ancient Ayurvedic wisdom and Sri Lankan traditional medicine are combined. Adhitya Ayurveda has also opened Adhitya Ayurveda Colombo, situated in the vibrant locale of Colombo 3. Additionally, they also operate Mangata, Sri Lanka\u2019s premier Ayurveda retreat on the Galle Coast."
