    "md5": "7547493428c378f2586daa0965cea451",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 701,
    "chunk_text": "Pregnancy kits donated at charitable event\n\nSri Lanka Thailand Society organised a charitable event\u00a0 called \u201cGabini Matha Sathkaraya\u201d on Poson poya day by donating Pregnancy kits to thirty pregnant women at MOH office, Mihintale,\u00a0 in the presence of His Excellency Paitoon Mahapannaporn Ambassador of Thailand in Sri Lanka.\n\nDr. Muditha Amarasinghe (MOH), Erandhi Kalanika Herath (Midwife), Prof. Preethi Weerathunga (Rajarata University), K.M. Dimuthu Chaminda (Project Coordinator ) The President of Sri Lanka Thailand Society Deshabandu K. Jayakumar, and Exco Members\u00a0 Champani Padmasekara, Tejitha Koralage and Amara Wanigaratne (Secretary to the Ambassador)\u00a0 \u00a0were present for the event."
